🚀 AI Space Mission Intelligence Dashboard

An interactive AI-powered dashboard built with Python and Streamlit to analyze historical space missions. 
The project provides mission analytics, interactive visualizations, filtering options, and a machine learning model to predict mission success. 
Designed with a futuristic space-themed UI using custom CSS.

Tech Stack:
• Python
• Streamlit
• Pandas
• Plotly
• Scikit-learn
• Joblib
• HTML & CSS

Features:
✔ Interactive Dashboard
✔ Mission Success Prediction
✔ Data Visualization
✔ KPI Metrics
✔ Country & Company Filters
✔ Downloadable Dataset
✔ Space-Themed Responsive UI
